Ares Atlas original art and implementation, November 2026
Custom colony architecture, material code, interface ornaments and suit animation
were authored for this project with AI assistance. Blender exports are in
game/assets/ares/. The fictional Martian guide portrait was generated with Grok
Imagine; its generation record is in game/assets/ares-ui/ARTWORK.md. It is retained
as legacy artwork and has been replaced in the interface by a human adviser.
These are not NASA assets.

Grok Imagine surface artwork, 14 November 2026
game/assets/ares/grok-regolith.jpg is original generated artistic regolith, not a NASA photograph or measured terrain. Generation: https://grok.com/imagine/post/8a17d34f-333c-44f5-b633-1a79f2ad3dc0 . The original downloaded image is retained unaltered. Interface/credits disclose AI artwork.

Grok Imagine human adviser, 14 November 2026
game/assets/ares-ui/mission-adviser.jpg is an original fictional human astronaut portrait generated for DEAD RECKONING: BLACKOUT. It is not a photograph of a NASA employee or evidence of agency endorsement. Generation: https://grok.com/imagine/post/fb3b487c-05ce-41b7-a8ec-346435ba61a9 . The downloaded image is used unaltered; the UI labels the character as fictional AI-generated artwork.

