BLACKOUT field instrument
The Blender-authored glove and dosimeter in game/assets/ares/surface-dosimeter.glb are original fictional game equipment. Its displayed index and the authored rock teaching-site placement are simulation choices, not NASA measurements or hardware certification. The source script and editable Blender scene are retained in art/blender/.

BLACKOUT original service kit and overnight implementation
Four AI-assisted Blender props (service-controller-b03.glb, water-witness-b03.glb,
crew-field-case-b03.glb and crew-tablet-b03.glb), their source builder and editable
blackout-service-kit.blend are original project work under the project licence.
